<title>UK: Commerzbank sets NZ$100 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets NZ$100 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and The Toronto-Dominion Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    26.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.35    PAY DATE    26.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC   1.00</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
